{"versionId":410,"visualScriptId":"ec1597bf-2752-4357-a043-f059a24192ad","managedNetworks":["Default"],"name":"Job - Add Banner/custom fields with variable","author":"stephen","description":"Update banner and custom fields","nodes":[{"nodeId":"01ed18ea-a813-4f30-8a13-0f6d42948b2f","versionId":410,"type":"memo","alias":"Variable","nodeConfig":{"content": "<p>The set variable section will add the values for each variable.  Those variables can be used in later section nodes.</p><p><br></p><p>Add Banner node:</p><p>the varibles can be used to update the banner.  Just put in the variable with sqiggly brackets</p><p><br></p><p>Update fields:</p><p>  put the variable with squiggly brackets into the specific field you want updated.</p>", "plainText": "The set variable section will add the values for each variable.  Those variables can be used in later section nodes.\n\nAdd Banner node:\nthe varibles can be used to update the banner.  Just put in the variable with sqiggly brackets\n\nUpdate fields:\n  put the variable with squiggly brackets into the specific field you want updated."},"nodeProperties":{"x": 170.581224153204, "y": 377.18404806257735, "data": {"name": "memo", "config": {"content": {"type": "String"}}, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "content", "tags": [], "type": "Model", "typeInference": "None", "typeInferenceMatchName": ""}], "isStartNode": false, "importConfigFixer": {}, "requiredPermissions": ["org.ziptie.playbook.cudPermission"], "requiredEntitlements": ["Playbooks"]}}},{"nodeId":"32862f2b-f6bf-4af0-839f-de5ac69dfce7","versionId":410,"type":"backup_device","alias":"Backup","nodeConfig":{},"nodeProperties":{"x": 1094.5175196652167, "y": 314.89051000913344, "data": {"name": "backup_device", "config": {}, "inputs": [{"name": "device", "type": "Model", "autowire": "None", "autowireOn": "NoConnection", "inputUsage": "User", "isOptional": false, "typeInference": "None"}], "outputs": [{"name": "changed", "tags": [], "type": "Model", "typeInference": "None", "t